# Track configuration only. Everything else here is session state, cache, or credentials:
# projects/ holds 749M of transcripts, file-history/ holds 94M of edit snapshots, and
# credential files land at this level. Ignore every path, then re-include configuration by name.
*

!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!settings.json
!keybindings.json

!agents/
!agents/**
!commands/
!commands/**
!hooks/
!hooks/**
!skills/
!skills/**
!output-styles/
!output-styles/**
